  "ShipLogDictionary": {
    "AICALE": "艾科尔",
    "AXIOM": "阿西姆",

    "Moon Warden": "月球守望者",
    "I met the moon warden living on Aicale.": "我遇见了居住在艾科尔的月球守望者。",
    "Asteroid Crater": "小行星陨石坑",
    "I heard from the Village Leader that there is an asteroid crashed down on Aicale": "我从村长那里听说，有一颗小行星坠毁在了艾科尔。",
    "I found a crater on the dark part of Aicale. The crater is small and there is an asteroid is lodged in it.": "我在艾科尔的暗面发现了一个陨石坑。坑体不大，里面嵌着一颗小行星。",

    "Axiom Village": "阿西姆上的村庄",
    "I found a village of people.": "我发现了人们住的村庄。",
    "Axiom Observatory": "阿西姆天文台",
    "I heard that there is a observatory/museum near the village.": "我听说村庄附近有个天文台/博物馆。",
    "I read a plaque in the Observatory's Museum.": "我在天文台的博物馆里阅读了一块铭牌。",
    "Axiom Traveler Tree House": "阿西姆探险者的树屋",
    "I heard there is resting spot for the astronauts.": "我听说有一处给宇航员休息的地方。",
    "The base is located on the opposite side of Axiom from the Village.": "宇航员基地在阿西姆上村庄的正对面。",
    "I talked to the travelers.": "我跟探险者们说了话。",

    "Axiom Satellite": "阿西姆卫星",
    "According to the Village Leader there is a satellite orbiting Axiom that needs repairs.": "据村长所说，有一颗需要维修的人造卫星环绕着阿西姆运行。",
    "The museum curator mentioned that the projector was staticky because the satellite it is connected to is broken.": "博物馆馆长提到，投影仪有静电干扰是因为与之连接的人造卫星出了故障。",
    "I orbited with the satellite.": "我找到了人造卫星。",
    "I fixed the broken satellite. The projector at the Observatory works again.": "我修好了损坏的人造卫星。天文台的投影仪恢复工作了。",
    "Axiom Escape Pod": "阿西姆逃生舱",
    "I heard about a crashed escape pod.": "我听说了一个坠毁的逃生舱。",
    "I found the escape pod.": "我找到了逃生舱。",
    "I learned how the villagers got here. They modified the ancient escape pod and shot it towards this system.": "我知道村民们怎么来到这里的了。他们改造了古代逃生舱并将它发射到这个星系。",
    "Gieselwald": "吉泽瓦尔多",
    "I found a talking jellyfish under the ice.": "我在冰下面找到了一只会说话的水母。",
    "Eornost": "厄诺斯拖",
    "I found a talking anglerfish under the ice.": "我在冰下面找到了一只会说话的安康鱼。"
  },
  "UIDictionary": {
    "Aicale": "艾科尔",
    "Radio": "无线电",
    "Warden Radio": "守望者的无线电",

    "Axiom": "阿西姆",
    "EscapePod": "逃生舱",
    "Alpha Escape Pod": "阿尔法逃生舱",
    "Quiet Town Radio": "宁静村庄无线电",
    "Quiet Town Satellite Dish": "宁静村庄人造卫星天线碟",

    "Traveler": "探险者",
    "Archeologist": "考古学家",
    "Astronomer": "天文学家",
    "Zen": "甄",
    "Woodsman": "伍兹曼",

    "Broken Satellite": "人造卫星",

    "Launching from dying solar system.": "正在从垂死恒星系中发射。",
    "On trajectory to crash into exoplanet.": "即将与系外行星发生碰撞。",
    "Successfully landed on exoplanet. Scanning planet for safety.": "成功着陆在系外行星。正在对行星进行安全扫描。",
    "It is covered in ice and a subsurface ocean beneath it. There is alien flora scattered across the surface and alien fauna below the ice.": "这颗星球表面覆盖着冰层，下方藏有地下海洋。地表散落着外星植物，冰层之下则栖息着外星生物。",
    "Detecting a moon orbiting the planet.": "检测到有一颗卫星环绕行星运行。",
    "Opening the stasis pods and escape door.": "正在开启休眠舱与逃生舱门。"//不生效
  },
  "DialogueDictionary": {
    "Launching from dying solar system.": "正在从垂死恒星系中发射。",
    "On trajectory to crash into exoplanet.": "即将与系外行星发生碰撞。",
    "Successfully landed on exoplanet. Scanning planet for safety.": "成功着陆在系外行星。正在对行星进行安全扫描。",
    "It is covered in ice and a subsurface ocean beneath it. There is alien flora scattered across the surface and alien fauna below the ice.": "这颗星球表面覆盖着冰层，下方藏有地下海洋。地表散落着外星植物，冰层之下则栖息着外星生物。",
    "Detecting a moon orbiting the planet.": "检测到有一颗卫星环绕行星运行。",
    "Opening the stasis pods and escape door.": "正在开启休眠舱与逃生舱门。", //不生效

    "Sign": "标示牌",
    "This tooth belongs to an adult version of the juvenile anglerfish in the tank. If adult proportions are consistent with that of the smaller fish, they must grow to nearly the size of our spacecraft!": "这颗牙齿来自水箱里那条幼年安康鱼对应的成年个体。要是成年安康鱼的身体比例和那条幼鱼保持一致，那它们长大后体型恐怕能接近我们的飞船大小！",
    "In this picture you can see the inside of the ancient civilization's Observatory on the south pole of Brittle Hollow.": "在这张图片中，你可以看见位于碎空星南极的古代文明天文台的内部。",
    "Here you can see a picture of Dark Bramble from our old solar system.": "你可以在这看见我们以前的恒星系中黑棘星的一张图片。",
    "It had long twisting vines and fog that hid anything that was inside.": "它长着蜿蜒缠绕的藤蔓，浓雾遮蔽了内部的一切。",
    "The only thing we know about this place was that it was the home of the Anglerfish.": "我们对它的全部了解只有它是安康鱼的家。",
    "This is a picture of our Escape Pod before we scooped it up and modified it for our getaway.": "这张照片拍的是我们的逃生舱在我们将它打捞起来、改装成逃亡工具之前的样子。",
    "It is sitting on one of the Hourglass Twins named Ember Twin.": "它位于沙漏双星之一的余烬双星上。",
    "This living anglerfish specimen was found attached to the landing gear of one of our spacecraft after a close flyby of a planet named Dark Bramble in our old solar system.": "这只活体安康鱼样本，是我们的一艘飞船在以前的太阳系内近距离飞越黑棘星后在起落架上发现的——它当时正附着在上面。",
    "Judging by the size of the recently-discovered adult anglerfish tooth, construction of a larger fish tank might be necessary.": "根据最近发现的成年安康鱼牙齿来看，建造一个更大的鱼缸可能是很有必要的。",
    "Here you can see a large antenna on top of a floating island.": "你可以看到浮岛顶端矗立着一座大型天线。",
    "This planet is named Giant's Deep and it is a cloud covered ocean world.": "这颗星球名为深巨星，是一颗被云层覆盖的海洋行星。",
    "We don't know what this antenna was used as we didn't have enough time to investigate the ancient people's history.": "我们尚不清楚这座天线的用途，因为我们根本没时间去探寻那些远古种族的历史过往。",
    "This crystal was taken from an ancient ruin on a planet named Brittle Hollow in our old solar system.": "这块水晶取自我们以前恒星系中碎空星上的一处古代遗迹",
    "It seems to create a local gravity distortion, and was most likely used to traverse steep surfaces.": "它似乎可以创造一处局部重力扭曲，并大概率被用来穿越陡峭的表面。",
    "Helmets like these are our explorers' windows on the Universe. Each helmet is custom-made to fit its wearer, with a stylish gold visor that provides protection from direct sun exposure.": "这类头盔是我们的探险者观察宇宙的窗口。每一顶都为佩戴者量身定制，配有时尚的金色面罩，可防护直射阳光。",
    "This piece of ancient technology bears a marked resemblance to the slide projector in this observatory's atrium.": "这件远古科技装置和天文台中庭里的幻灯机极为相似。",
    "This advanced alien technology adheres to inexplicably similar principles, and is a form of data projection device.": "这件先进的外星科技装置遵循着令人费解的相似原理，而且它也是一种数据投影装置。",
    "Our old home planet was the only one in that Solar System with an oxygen-rich atmosphere, which meant our astronauts must carry their own supply with them.": "我们以前的母星是恒星系中唯一有富氧大气层的行星，所以我们的宇航员必须随身携带氧气罐。",
    "These tanks are designed to automatically refill whenever oxygen is present, which allows the wearer to avoid an incredibly painful death-by-asphyxiation.": "这类氧气罐被设计为只要周围有氧气存在就能自动补充，从而让佩戴者避免因窒息造成的极度痛苦的死亡。",
    "This pilot seat is all that remains of our species' inaugural flight into space.": "这个驾驶座是我们种族首次太空飞行所遗留的全部了。",
    "Although it's been argued that such a distinction requires an overly-liberal definition of \"flight\", that day will always remain a landmark achievement in the history of our species.": "尽管有人争议我们对“飞行”的定义过于宽泛，但那一天始终是我们种族历史上的里程碑式成就。",
    "All of our spacecraft are powered by the intense chemical reaction that takes place inside this highly reinforced energy converter.": "我们所有的航天器均由一台加固的能量反应器内部发生的剧烈化学反应提供动力。",
    "Originally the conversion chamber wasn't reinforced at all, but that changed after an early model successfully converted 78% of the ship's hull into usable energy.": "最初这个反应器完全没有做加固处理，但这一情况在某款早期型号的反应器成功将飞船78%的船体转化为可用能量后彻底改变了。",
    "Some of our own expedition gear actually incorporates technology we've reverse-engineered from ancient artifacts.": "我们的部分探险装备实际上融合了一些通过远古文物逆向解析出的技术。",
    "This Surveyor Probe Mk IV features a limited warp ability that has dramatically reduced the rate at which our astronauts lose them to the depths of space.": "这款第四代探测器具备有限的跃迁能力，这一特性大幅降低了我们的宇航员将其遗失在茫茫太空之中的概率。",
    "In theory, this warp technology should also work on organic lifeforms, but further experimentation has been recently hampered by a sudden shortage of volunteers.": "理论上来说，这项跃迁技术也可用于有机生命体。但近期志愿者的突然短缺阻碍了后续相关实验的推进。",
    "We aren't quite sure why in this picture there is a cabin similar to the ones in our village.": "我们实在搞不清楚这张图片里为什么会出现一间和我们村庄里的小屋长得很像的屋子。",
    "It was taken from one of our probes after launching it into a ghostly moon.": "这张图片是探测器被发射进一个幽灵般的卫星后拍摄的。",
    "If we had more time in the old solar system, we might have been able to figure out what this is.": "如果我们在以前的恒星系有更多时间，我们也许能搞清楚这是什么。",
    "This ancient statue is the subject of a heated debate.": "这座古老的雕像成为了众人争论的焦点。",
    "The level-headed among us adhere to the obvious explanation that the statue simply phase-shifts whenever you look away from it.": "我们当中理性的人都认同一种显而易见的解释：只要你移开视线，这座雕像就会发生变化。",
    "That hasn't stopped our more imaginative thinkers from making the (ridiculous) argument that it actually exists in every possible configuration simultaneously and only collapses to a single state while it is being observed.": "但这并未阻止那些想象力丰富的人提出一种（荒诞的）观点：这座雕像实则同时存在于所有可能的形态之中，只有在被观测时，其状态才会坍缩为单一形态。",
    "Whatever the explanation, both sides agree that the effect is extremely creepy.": "无论解释是什么，双方都同意这种现象极其诡异。",
    "The discovery of this stone codex on the binary planets named the Hourglass Twins has allowed us to translate many of the symbols left behind by the ancient people who used to inhabit our old Solar System.": "在名为沙漏双星的双行星上，我们发现了这份石质典籍。借助它，我们成功破译了许多曾居住在我们以前太阳系中的远古居民留下的符号。",
    "Although this translation is an ongoing effort, we are fairly certain that this specific inscription is a recipe for cactus stew.": "尽管破译工作仍在推进，但我们已能笃定这段特定的符号记录的是一份仙人掌炖菜的食谱。",
    "In this picture you can see a ruin. It was once a building made by the ancient people who used to dwell in our old Solar System.": "你可以在这张照片里看到一处遗迹。它曾是一座建筑，由那些曾居住在我们旧太阳系的远古居民所建造。",
    "This is the only remnant of those ruins as we didn't take anything from them with us.": "这便是那片遗迹仅存的东西了，因为我们什么东西都没从遗迹中带走。",
    "This 1.5 million-year-old skull belonged to one of the ancient people who used to dwell in our old Solar System.": "这个有着150万年历史的头骨，属于一位曾居住在我们以前太阳系的远古先民。",
    "Although we have unearthed many of their artifacts and structures, we still have no idea where these people came from or what happened to them.": "虽然我们已经发掘了许多他们的文物和建筑，我们仍然不知道他们从哪里来、在他们身上发生了什么事。",
    "With only three eyes, it's easy to wonder if their disappearance had something to do with inferior depth perception.": "考虑到他们只有三只眼睛，人们自然地猜想他们的灭绝是否和较差的深度感知能力有关。",
    "These five displays depict the life cycle of a massive star similar to our sun. Such a star will remain in the Main Sequence phase the longest, as it gradually fuses the hydrogen in its core into helium.": "这五个展示装置描绘了一颗与太阳相似的大质量恒星的生命周期。这类恒星会在主序星阶段停留最久，在此期间，其核心会逐步将氢聚变为氦。",
    "Once all of its hydrogen has been fused into helium, the star begins fusing helium into even heavier elements.": "当恒星核心的氢全部聚变为氦后，它便会开始将氦聚变成更重的元素。",
    "The star is no longer generating heat by nuclear fusion, and the core becomes unstable and contracts. The outer shell of the star, which is still mostly hydrogen, starts to expand.": "恒星不再能通过核聚变产生热量，其核心变得不稳定并开始坍缩。而恒星的外层（仍以氢元素为主）则会向外膨胀。",
    "The star is now a Red Supergiant, and well into its dying stages. As its core fuses heavier and heavier elements, gravitational collapse becomes inevitable.": "这颗恒星现已演变为红超巨星，步入生命的末期阶段。随着其核心不断聚变成越来越重的元素，引力坍缩已不可避免。",
    "Finally, the core collapses and the star explodes in a massive cosmic event known as a Supernova.": "最终，恒星核心坍缩，整颗恒星在一场被称为“超新星爆发”的超级宇宙级事件中爆炸。",
    "This is exactly what happened to our old star. We estimated we had 2 million years left but we were way off.": "我们原来的太阳正是如此消亡的。我们曾估计我们还有200万年的时间，可实际偏差巨大。",
    "In this picture you can see a picture of a space station that orbited our old star.": "从这张图片中你可以看见一个环绕我们以前恒星的空间站。",
    "We never landed on it but we were able to launch probes that took this photo.": "我们从没能降落在它上面，但我们可以发射拍下了这张照片的探测器。",
    "Watch closely...these balls move on their own!": "仔细看...这些球体在自己移动！",
    "The ground is perfectly level, so what do you think causes this spooky motion?": "地面极为平整，所以你认为是什么让它们动起来？",
    "The answer is the moon! As it orbits our planet, the moon's gravity pulls on objects from different directions...it's pulling on you right now!": "答案是卫星！它环绕我们的行星运行并用重力从不同的方向拉动物体。它现在就在拉着你！",
    "This crater has always been our home. In fact, for generations we assumed it was the entire world.": "这个陨石坑一直是我们的家。事实上，几代人以来我们都以为它就是整个世界。",
    "It has now been destroyed by our old star and nothing is left of it.": "它现在早已被我们以前的恒星摧毁，什么都没留下。",
    "We may have a new home but Timber Hearth is still our favorite.": "我们也许有了个新家，但木炉星永远是我们最爱的地方。",

    "Archaeologist": "考古学家",
    "Hey there. Warm yourself by the fire. It's good to have company on a night like this.": "嗨。来火边暖暖身子吧。很高兴在这样的夜晚有个伴。",
    "What instrument is that?": "这是什么乐器？",
    "What is your job about?": "你的工作是做什么的？",
    "I'll see you later.": "稍后再见。",
    "What else can I do for you?": "我还能为你做些什么？",
    "I'm playing the banjo. I like it because it playing it is similar to digging through layers of history, each pluck unearthing a new story. Simple as that.": "我在弹班卓琴。我喜欢它，因为弹班卓琴就像一层层挖掘历史，每拨一下弦，都能发掘出一个新故事。就这么简单。",
    "I agree": "我同意。",
    "My job is to study ancient civilizations and uncover artifacts or fossils that are buried in the ground.": "我的工作是研究古代文明和发掘埋在地里的文物或化石。",
    "Nowadays I don't do much as there isn't much to study.": "最近我没有太多工作要做了，因为已经没有那么多东西要研究了。",
    "Back in our old solar system there was an ancient civilization but we didn't figure out much about them other than how to modify their tech.": "我们以前的太阳系那里曾存在一个远古文明——但除了懂得如何改造他们的技术，我们对他们知之甚少。",
    "Bye bye.": "拜拜。",

    "Astronomer": "天文学家",
    "The fire welcomes all who seek its warmth.": "火堆欢迎所有寻求温暖的人。",
    "I'm playing the drums. I like it because you can feel the pulsating rhythm of it.": "我在打鼓。我喜欢打鼓，因为能感受到它那富有冲击力的脉动节奏。",
    "My job is to collect and analyse data from satellites and spacecraft. I also monitor the stars using my telescope.": "我的工作是收集和分析卫星与航天器传回的数据，同时我也会用望远镜监测恒星。",
    "The only thing dangerous I've encountered so far is those Anglerfish back in our old solar system.": "我目前唯一遇见过的危险事物只有那些生活在以前太阳系的安康鱼。",

    "Coach": "飞行教练",
    "I have been very bored ever since my trainees have left.": "自从我的学员们离开后，我就一直觉得很无聊。",
    "Maybe you should find something to do": "也许你应该找一些事情做。",
    "Nah. If there is nobody to coach then there is no point.": "不了。要是没人可教导，这事儿就没意义了。",

    "Craftsman": "工匠",
    "Well, I'll be... You're not something you see every day! What brings you here, stranger?": "好了，我很快......你这号人物可不多见啊！什么风把你吹来了，陌生人？",
    "I see you are looking at the stars.": "我发现你正在看星星。",
    "I've spent many nights out here, studying the stars and marveling at their beauty. There's always something new to discover, something that makes you appreciate just how vast and wondrous the universe really is.": "我在这儿度过了无数个夜晚，观测恒星，惊叹于它们的璀璨。宇宙中总有新的事物等待着被人发现，总有一些瞬间让你深深体会到它究竟有多辽阔、多奇妙。",

    "Curator": "博物馆馆长",
    "Well, isn't this a surprise! We don't get many extraterrestrial visitors in our village. What brings you here, traveler?": "哇，真是个惊喜！我们村子可不常来外星访客呢。是什么风把你吹到这儿来的,旅行者？",
    "Just having a look around.": "只是过来看一看。",
    "I fixed the satellite.": "我修好了人造卫星。",
    "Any problems?": "有什么问题吗？",
    "Bye": "拜拜。",
    "Recently I've been seeing only static on my projector near the entrance.": "最近靠近门口的那台投影仪，画面里一直只有杂乱的静电干扰。",
    "It is supposed to connect to the satellite orbiting the planet but it seems the signal is broken.": "它本应连接到环绕这颗行星的人造卫星上，但卫星的天线似乎损坏了。",
    "Could you go up there and fix it for me? I would ask the travelers but they are resting after exploring for a bit.": "你能上去修好它吗？我本来要找探险者们，但他们仍在进行探险之后的休息。",
    "No problem": "没问题。",
    "Oh thank you! The projector is finally gonna work again!": "哦谢谢你！投影仪终于重新工作了！",
    "You're welcome": "不用谢。",
    "You should go check on the projector in front now that it is fixed.": "既然投影仪已经修好了，你可以去查看它了。",
    "It may not be too interesting but it is something.": "它可能不是非常有趣，但它至少是些什么。",
    "Well I hope you find the exhibits interesting.": "好吧，我希望你觉得展览很有趣。",
    "Ok": "好的。",
    "Safe travels.": "一路平安。",

    "Eornost": "厄诺斯拖",
    "Hey it's me Eornost the magic talking anglerfish.": "嗨，是我，会说话的魔法安康鱼厄诺斯拖。",
    "Eornost? Don't you mean Ernesto.": "厄诺斯拖？你是想说厄内斯托吧。",
    "Wow you can talk?": "哇，你能说话？",
    "Gieselwald says hi.": "吉泽瓦尔多向你问好。",
    "Did you want to talk about anything else.": "你想聊些其他的吗？",
    "No, I am Eornost! The second anglerfish to ever live!": "不，我是厄诺斯拖！有史以来的第二安康鱼！",
    "Only second?": "只是第二？",
    "Cool...": "酷...",
    "Come on man. Do I look Spaceworthy to you?": "拜托，兄弟。你看我像是能上太空的样子吗？",
    "The first anglerfish to ever live was Spaceworthy!": "有史以来的第一安康鱼是能上太空的！",
    "No I can't. You must be mistaken.": "不，我不能。你一定是搞错了。",
    "That wasn't a joke. You've been in a coma for 20 years. WAKE UP!": "这不是个笑话。你已经昏迷了20年了。<![CDATA[<i>快醒来！</i>]]>",
    "What?!": "什么？！",
    "Glad to hear they are doing alright.": "很高兴听到他一切都好。",
    "We are a married couple.": "我们是结了婚的一对儿。",
    "Nice": "不错。",

    "Gieselwald": "吉泽瓦尔多",
    "Hey it's me Gieselwald the magic talking jellyfish.": "嗨，是我，会说话的魔法水母吉泽瓦尔多。",
    "I hate you.": "我讨厌你。",
    "I love you.": "我喜欢你。",
    "Are you related to Eornost?": "你跟厄诺斯拖之间有什么联系吗？",
    "I have to go.": "我得走了。",
    "I'm sorry but I'm taken.": "抱歉，我已经有伴侣了。",
    "Oh my bad, they must consider themselves very lucky.": "哦不好意思。他一定很幸运。",
    "Okay... That's pretty rude bro...": "奥...这样说真粗鲁...",
    "You're right. I apologize.": "你是对的。我向你道歉。",
    "Okay nevermind I hate you.": "好吧没关系我讨厌你。",
    "Not related but we are in a relationship.": "我们之间没有联系，但我们之间有关系。",
    "Good for you": "那很好。",
    "Okay, say hi to Eornost for me!": "好的，帮我向厄诺斯拖问好！",
    "Okay": "好的。",

    "Moon Warden": "月球守望者",
    "Well, well, what do we have here? You're not from around these parts, are you?": "哇哦哇哦，看我遇到了谁？你不是从这附近来的，对吧？",
    "It's not often I get visitors up here...you know, it being the moon and all. What can I do you for?": "我在这里很少有访客...你知道的，这里是月球。我能为你做什么？",
    "Where's that music coming from?": "这个音乐是哪来的？",
    "Anything here worth checking out?": "这里有什么值得看的东西吗？",
    "So what is it you do here?": "所以，你在这里做什么？",
    "What can I do you for?": "我能为你做些什么？",
    "Gotta go.": "得走了。",
    "See that radio I cobbled together over there? I calibrated it to pick up the music being played back home.": "看到那边我拼凑起来的收音机了吗？我已经校准过了，能接收到家乡正在播放的音乐。",
    "Honestly, I think this place is pretty dull. I'm really the only thing here.": "说实话，我觉得这地方挺无聊的。这儿真的就只有我一个。",
    "I'm the warden of Aicale. I live here on the moon overseeing anything happening back on Axiom. Sometimes the travelers stop by for repairs.": "我是艾科尔的守望者。我住在这颗卫星上，守望着阿西姆上发生的一切。有时会有探险者中途停靠，来这儿维修设备。",
    "Hey, fancy seeing you here...on the MOON!!!": "嘿，真没想到能在这儿见到你——在<![CDATA[<i>月球</i>]]>上！！！",

    "Outfitter": "装备师",
    "What the… an alien? How did you get here?": "什么鬼...一个外星人？你怎么到这来的？",
    "Flying": "星际航行。",
    "Of course. The most obvious answer.": "当然。最显然的答案。",

    "Rocket Kid": "拿玩具火箭的小孩",
    "Hey there! Look at my cool toy rocket ship.": "你好！看我的超酷玩具火箭。",
    "Very nice": "非常好。",

    "Rocket Scientist": "飞船科学家",
    "We have the launch pad over there but we haven't used it in a bit.": "那边有个发射台，但我们有一阵子没用过它了。",
    "I'm using it": "我正在用它。",
    "Why not?": "为什么不用呢？",
    "Anything else I can do for ya?": "我还能为你做什么？",
    "Why isn't the launchpad being used?": "为什么发射台没被使用呢？",
    "Well glad to see it is getting some use.": "很高兴看到它派上用场。",
    "Why isn't it being used?": "为什么它没被使用呢？",
    "There isn't much reason for anything to land there": "这里没太多让飞行器之类的东西降落的理由。",
    "The astronauts sometimes land on it but they are usually out exploring other planets or resting at their base.": "探险者们有时降落在它上面，但他们通常都在探索其他行星或在他们的基地休息。",
    "I am waiting until I can make another rocket ship. Takes a while to gather materials for it sadly.": "我在等着制造另外一艘飞船，但很遗憾收集足够材料要花很久。",
    "Maybe Coach can train a new astronaut to fly it.": "也许飞行教练能训练一名新的宇航员来驾驶它。",
    "Where can I find the astronaut's base?": "我该怎么去宇航员的基地？",
    "Well I hope you can built it soon.": "好吧，我希望你很快就能着手制造它。",
    "It should be on the other side of Axiom. There is a campfire there so look for the rising smoke.": "它应该在阿西姆的另一边。那里有个篝火，所以注意扬起来的烟雾。",
    "Thanks": "谢谢。",
    "Farewell": "再见。",

    "Skeptic": "多疑者",
    "Who're you?": "你是谁？",
    "I come in peace.": "我为和平而来。",
    "Uh-huh, sure you do. You expect me to believe that?": "呃，你当然会这么说。你指望我相信这个？",
    "I assure you, my intentions are purely peaceful.": "我向你保证，我的意图完全是和平的。",
    "And why should I trust you? You could be here to conquer us, or worse.": "我为什么要相信你？你说不定是来征服我们的，甚至更糟。",
    "I have no interest in conquest": "我对征服没有兴趣。",
    "I don't know... it all sounds too good to be true.": "我不知道...这一切听起来好过头了。",
    "I am just exploring the planet.": "我只是想探索这颗行星。",
    "Well, forgive me if I'm not convinced just yet. How do I know you're not just spinning a tale to lower our guard?": "好吧，要是我现在还没信服，请你见谅。我怎么知道你不是在编瞎话，好让我们放松警惕呢？",
    "Allow me to earn your trust, one step at a time.": "请允许我一步步赢得你的信任。",
    "Alright, but I've got my eye on you. One wrong move, and you'll have the whole village to answer to.": "行吧，但我会盯着你。敢出一点差错，整个村子都不会放过你。",
    "I've got my eye on you. One wrong move, and you'll have the whole village to answer to.": "我会盯着你。敢出一点差错，整个村子都不会放过你。",

    "Telescope Kid": "拿望远镜的小孩",
    "Whoa, are you an alien? I've never seen anything like you before!": "哇，你是外星人吗？我以前从未见过任何像你这样的东西！",
    "Indeed I am. Is that a telescope?": "我确实是。那是个望远镜吗？",
    "Yeah! I love looking at the stars. My telescope helps me see the planets and the galaxies far, far away.": "是的！我喜欢看星星。我的望远镜帮我看到很远、很远之外的行星和星系。",

    "Village Leader": "村长",
    "By the stars! What manner of being are you?": "星星在上！你究竟是什么生物？",
    "A wandering traveler.": "我是一个到处跑的旅行者。",
    "I am Astronaut from the future!": "我是从未来来的宇航员！",
    "Future? How'd you even get here?": "未来？那你是怎么到这里来的？",
    "I woke up in this solar system.": "我在这个恒星系中醒来。",
    "If you don't know how you got here then why would you be from the future?": "如果你不知道你怎么来的，那你怎么知道你来自未来？",
    "Just a feeling.": "只是一种感觉。",
    "Welcome to our little village. Explore the planet or talk to the other villagers.": "欢迎来到我们的小村庄。探索行星并跟其他村民聊天。",
    "Welcome to our little village then. Explore the planet or talk to the other villagers.": "欢迎来到我们的小村庄。探索行星并跟其他村民聊天。",
    "Where should I go first?": "我应该先去哪？",
    "I fixed the satellite": "我修好了卫星。",
    "I gotta go.": "我得走了。",
    "The only thing I can think of would be that broken satellite orbiting between the moon and here.": "我能想到的唯一东西只有那颗在月球与这里之间运行的故障人造卫星。",
    "Why is it broken?": "它为什么坏了？",
    "It got hit by some asteroids. One asteroid ended up crashing into Aicale.": "它被小行星撞击了。有一颗小行星落在了艾科尔上。",
    "We don't have anyway to get up there and fix it.": "我们没有任何办法上去把它修好。",
    "We have astronauts but they just came back from an exploration so I didn't want to bother them yet.": "我们有一些宇航员，但他们刚探险回来，所以我不想麻烦他们。",
    "I believe you may be able to restore it to working order.": "我相信你可以让它恢复到工作状态。",
    "I'll try": "我会试试看。",
    "Thank you! The Curator would happy to know the satellite snapshot is working again.": "谢谢你！博物馆馆长会很高兴得知人造卫星的摄像又能工作了。",
    "I'll let them know": "我会让他知道的。",
    "Maybe check out our crashed escape pod. We modified and launched it to get away from our dying star.": "也许你可以看看我们坠毁的逃生舱。我们为了逃离我们垂死的恒星改装并发射了它。",
    "It should be in the direction that large signal dish is facing.": "它应该在大天线碟面对的那个方向。",
    "Anywhere else?": "还有其他地方吗？",
    "Got it": "明白了。",
    "Something else...": "其他地方...",
    "How about the observatory. It is on the other side of the village.": "天文台怎么样？它就在村庄的另一边。",
    "Basically the opposite direction of the escape pod.": "基本上就在逃生舱那个方向的反方向。",
    "See you later.": "等会再见。",

    "Woodsman": "伍兹曼",
    "Hello there, stranger.": "你好，陌生人。",
    "What are you doing?": "你在做什么？",
    "What is this place?": "这里是什么地方？",
    "Why do you live here?": "你为什么住在这里？",
    "What else can I do for ya?.": "我还能为你做什么？",
    "Just playing some music by the campfire.": "只是在篝火旁演奏音乐。",
    "I see": "好吧。",
    "This is the traveler's treehouse.": "这里是探险者的树屋。",
    "All 4 of us live here at this campsite.": "我们四个都住在这里。",
    "Awesome": "好极了。",
    "This is our base. We stop here and rest after astronauting.": "这里是我们的基地。我们在星际航行后在这里停下休息。",
    "There is much to explore out there, but it can wait for sleep.": "外面有很多值得探索的东西，但它们可以等我们睡完一觉。",
    "So true": "太对了。",
    "This is my harmonica. The perfect instrument for someone like me!": "这是我的口琴。像我这样的人最适合这乐器了！",
    "My job is to go in and scout out the area first before the others come.": "我的工作是在别人过来前优先进入并侦查区域。",

    "Zen": "甄",
    "Sit, and let the warmth of the fire embrace you.": "坐下来，让火焰的温暖包裹你。",
    "My job is pretty easy. I just do miscellaneous tasks that Mission Control asks for.": "我的工作挺简单的，就是做任务控制中心安排的各种杂活",
    "I'm playing a flute. It is basically me if I were an instrument.": "我在吹长笛。这乐器简直就是我的化身。",
    "The flute has always been my companion on this journey through life. Its melodies speak to the soul.": "长笛始终是我人生旅途中的伴侣。它的旋律能触动灵魂。"
  }
}
